# Metro Cardz — Hostinger VPS Process Definitions
# =================================================
# Hostinger Web App Hosting = Node.js only (runs the Next.js app)
# Hostinger VPS (optional) = can run this Python API
#
# On Hostinger VPS, use systemd instead of Procfile.
# Example systemd service — see DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md for full instructions.
#
# Start the FastAPI web server:
web: gunicorn app.main:app -w 2 -k uvicorn.workers.UvicornWorker --bind 127.0.0.1:8000 --timeout 120 --preload
